---
title: "Imaging Equipment and Protections"
code: "RAD-110"
category: "radiography"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/RAD-105"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisites: RAD 105 and RAD 245"
---

Discusses the basic components of a radiographic unit, principles of x-ray production, principles of image receptors, automatic processing, film evaluation and concepts in radiation protection and radiobiology. Lecture 3 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
